    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to BUSH SIMULATOR</h2>The game you didn\u2019t ask for, but you\u2019re getting anyway!<br><br>What\u2019s the point?<br>Who knows?! All you do is gaze at a bush from every possible angle. That\u2019s it. Seriously.<br><br>EPIC FEATURES:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTREME BUSH VIEWING:</h2> Get ready to see a bush like never before\u2014because you\u2019ve never really looked at a bush until you\u2019ve played Bush Simulator.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTHING HAPPENS:</h2> No quests, no enemies, no plot. Just you, a camera, and one magnificent bush.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAFY OVERLOAD:</h2> This bush has leaves. So many leaves. It\u2019s practically drowning in them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why play?</h2>Because sometimes, you just need to do absolutely nothing\u2014and what better way to do that than with a bush? So, grab your popcorn, sit back, and enjoy the ride (or rather, the lack thereof). Bush Simulator: The ultimate non-adventure awaits!",
